  "controls": [
    "Five consecutive status observations established zero demand, inactive activation, no next alarm, and no last run before the quiet-window guard began.",
    "The pre-control returned nonzero Worker and Durable Object request estimates through the same analytics reader.",
    "The post-control returned nonzero request estimates after the quiet window and includes a successful 511-backed public witness.",
    "Both aggregate and hourly forms of every dataset were read after an additional settlement interval; all reads completed with errors [].",
    "The quiet window excludes the five-minute post-disarm guard and ends before the first post-window probe.",
    "Worker controls covered the gateway; Durable Object request controls covered all three deployed scripts across the script-attributed dataset union. Storage returned no rows before, during, or after the quiet window and therefore has no positive control."
  ],
  "interpretation": {
    "result": "idle-to-zero-observed-by-settled-analytics",
    "derivedQuietTotals": {
      "estimatedWorkerRequests": 0,
      "estimatedWorkerExecutionGbS": 0,
      "estimatedDurableObjectRequests": 0,
      "observedAccountWideDurableObjectActiveTimeUs": 0
    },
    "emptyRowRule": "The quiet interval is reported as an observed zero estimate because the adjacent controls returned nonzero rows through the same settled aggregate and hourly queries, every dataset reported errors [], the retained pre/post application status observations were explicitly disarmed, and the post-window public witness proved the deployment remained live.",
    "adaptiveSamplingCaveat": "workersInvocationsAdaptive and durableObjectsInvocationsAdaptiveGroups may use Cloudflare adaptive sampling. Their quiet-window result contained no rows and thus no sampleInterval or confidence information. The record therefore does not claim an absolute absence of every event or an invoice guarantee.",
    "positiveControlScope": "Worker controls emitted estimates only for the gateway. Durable Object request controls emitted estimates for the gateway, handler, and action handler. Coverage of all three identities is across the two script-attributed datasets as a union, not within each dataset.",
    "accountWideCaveat": "durableObjectsPeriodicGroups and durableObjectsStorageGroups expose no script identity on this GraphQL surface. Their raw rows are account-wide context and are not attributed to All Aboard. The deployment-specific observation rests on workersInvocationsAdaptive and durableObjectsInvocationsAdaptiveGroups, which include scriptName dimensions. The empty periodic result supports only the account-wide observation of 0 microseconds active time in this interval.",
    "storageTelemetryCaveat": "durableObjectsStorageGroups returned no row in the pre-control, quiet, or post-control windows, so there is no positive storage control. maxStoredBytes is the reader's numeric summary of an empty array; it is telemetry absence, not evidence of zero stored bytes, zero storage usage, or deletion of persisted application data.",
